            "Store contiguous bands along the shorter dimension, transposing during input when needed; incrementally update band sums for contiguous scans.",
            "Use a dynamically sized, generation-stamped open-addressed frequency table for full-width signed prefix sums, with private per-thread state.",
            "Parallelize independent start-boundary groups using OpenMP static scheduling with chunk size one and a reduction; retain a serial path below 200000 estimated pair-row operations."
